# A simple brightness controller in Nushell

Inspired by
[`brightnessctl`](https://github.com/Hummer12007/brightnessctl),
`brightness.nu` provides a simple CLI to change brightness.  It can be
used via `use path/to/brightness.nu` and is documented using Nushell
built-in doc comments.  To install the necessary `udev` rules, run
`toolkit install`.
